GPUI, gpui-pre 0.3.9 as published (a snapshot of Zed at 93d7456), with the changes Mu needs until a
gpui-pre snapshot has them:

- A window that changes between the mouse and the keyboard draws all of itself again after the
  event that changes it, not before (`modality_changed` in `window.rs`). A key press into a window
  that needs drawing draws it before it's dispatched, so the first key press after the mouse drew
  the whole window twice.
- Text cut in the middle keeps its last word and the extension after it, in between a third and
  four fifths of the room, and the start gets the rest (`should_truncate_line_middle` in
  `line_wrapper.rs`). A fixed third often fit only the extension, so numbered names like
  "IMG_0012.jpeg" all looked alike.

